本書分五卷研讀主耶穌的二十七個比喻，整合 CCIC 週四查經班教導、John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，並附原文字義、約翰福音貫通與對觀平行考據。全書以馬太福音 13:35 為總綱：「我要開口用比喻，把創世以來所隱藏的事發明出來。」

A study of twenty-seven parables of Jesus in five volumes, integrating the Thursday Bible Class teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis, with Greek word studies, connections to John's Gospel, and synoptic parallels.
